    "competition": "Not measured in this evaluation.",
    "prices": "Waters, soft drinks and juices: prices relative to the CPI: +7.6% (log points) (p = 0.20; detectable from 22.0). Beer: prices relative to the CPI: +4.8% (log points) (p = 0.44; detectable from 22.0).",
